{"id":"e72ce9e8de4a5cad","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-taylor.md","title":"Taylor","display":"df-taylor — Taylor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-taylor","aliases":["58-df-taylor"],"display":"df-taylor — Taylor","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-taylor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-taylor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-taylor — Taylor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,f,a,N,U,n\\in V\">\\(T,f,a,N,U,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S\\)</span> (word-indexed partial-derivative tower; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S\\)</span> (Euclidean domain and continuity predicates supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TaylorPolynomial}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TaylorPolynomial}_S\\)</span> (Taylor-polynomial value relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)=\\{\\langle x,\\{\\langle0,f(x)\\rangle\\}\\rangle:x\\in U\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)=\\{\\langle x,\\{\\langle0,f(x)\\rangle\\}\\rangle:x\\in U\\}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md\">../batch15/58-df-smooth.md</a>；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(s)(a)\\in\\mathbb R^1\">\\(F(s)(a)\\in\\mathbb R^1\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(s)(a)(0)\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(F(s)(a)(0)\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}taylor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TaylorPolynomial}_S(T,f,a,N,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land N\\in\\omega\n\\land a\\in U\\land \\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists F\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U),U,n,1,N)\n\\land\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq N}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),U,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\\operatorname{Function}(T,\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\Biggl[\nT(x)=\\sum_{r\\leq N}\\frac1{r!}\n\\sum_{s\\in n^r}F(s)(a)(0)\\prod_{j\\in r}\\bigl(x(s(j))-a(s(j))\\bigr)\n\\Biggr]\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}taylor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TaylorPolynomial}_S(T,f,a,N,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land N\\in\\omega\n\\land a\\in U\\land \\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists F\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U),U,n,1,N)\n\\land\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq N}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),U,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\\operatorname{Function}(T,\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\Biggl[\nT(x)=\\sum_{r\\leq N}\\frac1{r!}\n\\sum_{s\\in n^r}F(s)(a)(0)\\prod_{j\\in r}\\bigl(x(s(j))-a(s(j))\\bigr)\n\\Biggr]\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The polynomial records the finite jet of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The coefficients come from the dependency's actual word-indexed derivative tower. Summing over coordinate words and dividing by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r!\">\\(r!\\)</span> is the symmetric multi-index Taylor formula.</li>\n<li>Equality with an infinite Taylor series requires analyticity; smoothness alone does not imply it.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S$ (word-indexed partial-derivative tower; see [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S$ and $\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S$ (Euclidean domain and continuity predicates supplied by [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-smooth.md","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)=\\{\\langle x,\\{\\langle0,f(x)\\rangle\\}\\rangle:x\\in U\\}$ 使用 [[../batch15/58-df-smooth.md]]；因此 $F(s)(a)\\in\\mathbb R^1$，而 $F(s)(a)(0)\\in\\mathbb R$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,f,a,N,U,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TaylorPolynomial}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U)=\\{\\langle x,\\{\\langle0,f(x)\\rangle\\}\\rangle:x\\in U\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F(s)(a)\\in\\mathbb R^1","display":false},{"tex":"F(s)(a)(0)\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}taylor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TaylorPolynomial}_S(T,f,a,N,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land N\\in\\omega\n\\land a\\in U\\land \\mathrm{EuclideanOpen}_S(U,n)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists F\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\operatorname{Function}(f,U,\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{PartialDerivativeTower}_S(F,\\mathrm{RealScalarLift}_S(f,U),U,n,1,N)\n\\land\\forall s\\in n^{\\leq N}\\;\\mathrm{EuclideanContinuous}_S(F(s),U,1)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\\operatorname{Function}(T,\\mathbb R^n,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\Biggl[\nT(x)=\\sum_{r\\leq N}\\frac1{r!}\n\\sum_{s\\in n^r}F(s)(a)(0)\\prod_{j\\in r}\\bigl(x(s(j))-a(s(j))\\bigr)\n\\Biggr]\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"r!","display":false}],"bytes":1947,"backlinks":[{"id":"50f0afd61c5e6fe6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1285","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-taylor.md|58-df-taylor]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","17de8347f6f91384"]}